; matra-guna: SI prefix scaling ladder.
; each prefix is a power of 10 that scales a base unit.
; nano + metre = nanometre = metre at 10^-9.
; the ladder itself is a kramanusara structure —
; each step is a multiplicative rate of change.

(kosha matra-guna
  (vishesa physics-varga)
  (sthita matra yantra)
  (swarupa guna)
  (yukta sankhya))
